  <strong class="font-semibold">About these checks:</strong> readiness runs execute source checks (typecheck, architecture and release tests). They run in CI and on a developer machine; the production server carries no source, so a run recorded from it shows <code>NOT_CONFIGURED</code> rather than a result. Nothing here pushes code, publishes tags or changes consent settings.
